  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 528ecde27feefd74eb359b784c14f552, type: 3}
  m_Name: Andy
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DollConfig
  dollName: Andy
  dollOwner: Devin Stokes, 8 y.o., male, alive
  dollStory: "Devin Stokes created Andy during arts and crafts with the help of his
    teacher, and it quickly became his favorite toy. Ever since Devin brought the
    doll home, the Stokes family began hearing strange noises at night. At one point,
    Devin's father found the doll placed in various locations\u2014some of which
    were too high for young Devin to reach, or even locked away. Though there had
    been no overtly threatening behavior from the doll, the family decided to return
    it to the school. However, the doll mysteriously reappeared in Devin's room overnight.
    Even more unsettling, the doll had somehow been placed\u2014or had entered\u2014Devin's
    mouth while he slept, nearly choking him. It seems the doll is most likely going
    to move again."
  dollReason: "Andy harbors a mischievous spirit, one that likely only has the ability
    to move when its surroundings are obstructed from view. Beyond that, the spirit
    seems to form attachments, as evidenced by the way it plotted revenge when it
    was taken away from Devin\u2014almost choking him in the process. Because of
    this, the spirit is considered dangerous, and the doll has been destroyed."
